2026-07-26T10:38:19.8576234Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-26T10:38:19.8635140Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-26T10:38:19.8635747Z i /tmp/Rtmpclj6ql/duckdb
2026-07-26T10:38:19.8636124Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-26T10:38:19.8636548Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-26T10:38:19.8637219Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-26T10:38:19.8637937Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-26T10:38:19.8639184Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-26T10:38:19.8639859Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-26T10:38:19.8866431Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-26T10:38:19.8969324Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-26T10:38:19.9357800Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-26T10:38:19.9494762Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
